# German texts of mujina-adapter-windows that Mujina Settings shows: the titles of its checks,
# and what those of Developer Mode and the background agent say on the System page. Compiled in
# (CATALOGS in src/lib.rs); `cargo xtask i18n-check` lists what is missing.
msgid ""
msgstr ""
